@startuml

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Student

component "Assistant UI" as UI
component "Backend API" as API
component "Authentication Service" as AUTH
component "AI Agent / Orchestrator" as AGENT
component "Moodle Connector" as MOODLECON
component "Context Builder" as CONTEXT
component "Gemini Client" as GEMINI

database "University Assistant DB" as DB

cloud "Moodle" as MOODLE
cloud "Google Gemini API" as GEMINIAPI

Student --> UI : asks question

UI --> API : HTTPS request

API --> AUTH : authenticate user
API --> AGENT : process request

AGENT --> MOODLECON : request Moodle data
MOODLECON --> MOODLE : Web Services API
MOODLE --> MOODLECON : course/assignment data

AGENT --> CONTEXT : build context
CONTEXT --> DB : read cached data
CONTEXT --> GEMINI : prepared context

GEMINI --> GEMINIAPI : generateContent()
GEMINIAPI --> GEMINI : generated response

GEMINI --> AGENT : AI answer
AGENT --> API : final response
API --> UI : answer
UI --> Student : display answer

API --> DB : conversation/log data

@enduml